1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,433
AI could build damn near anything now.

2
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:05,567
So why the fuck do I need five different tools?

3
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:07,800
Because they don't do the same job.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,666
ChatGPT,
figure out what I'm building.

5
00:00:10,666 --> 00:00:12,566
Claude Code,
build it.

6
00:00:12,566 --> 00:00:14,566
Gemini,
help me see it.

7
00:00:14,566 --> 00:00:17,033
Supabase,
make it remember shit.

8
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:19,267
Netlify,
put it online.

9
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:20,300
That's my stack.

10
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,500
Five tools,
one job.

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,033
Get this shit out my head
and onto the internet.
